msgctxt "437\t523"
msgid "Ugh, this heat's a freakin' killer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "529\t596"
msgid "Hey there, punks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "631\t691"
msgid "It's him!"
msgstr "È lui!"

msgctxt "712\t790"
msgid "Want something, old man?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792\t922"
msgid "You two are in the Ryudo Family, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "924\t1004"
msgid "So what if we are?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1006\t1239"
msgid ""
"You boys make a habit of dishing out\\neviction notices to ordinary "
"civilians?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1262\t1352"
msgid "\"Civilian,\" huh? You're funny."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1355\t1476"
msgid "Don't think I've ever seen a civilian\\nwith that kinda ink on his back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1478\t1566"
msgid "Either way, you can't keep scaring my kids."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1569\t1657"
msgid "I don't want to see your faces again. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1670\t1730"
msgid "Listen here, man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1751\t1876"
msgid "Ain't nobody we hate more\\nthan arrogant outsiders like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1894\t1982"
msgid "Now get the hell outta Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1988\t2058"
msgid "...That's why you're trying to evict me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2060\t2112"
msgid "Can't say."
msgstr "Non posso dirlo."

msgctxt "2113\t2180"
msgid "If you wanna know the truth..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2197\t2283"
msgid "You'll have to ask our boss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2362\t2422"
msgid "Just a sec there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2430\t2490"
msgid "Where do you think you're goin'?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2494\t2565"
msgid "To the Ryudo office."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2577\t2666"
msgid "Could use a chat with this boss of yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2685\t2786"
msgid "Aniki! We've gotta warn him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2833\t2937"
msgid "He doesn't have time to deal\\nwith petty shit like this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2991\t3083"
msgid "Our only job right now\\nis keepin' this guy in check."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3108\t3269"
msgid "So sorry to say, I can't let you\\njust stroll on over to our office."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3285\t3383"
msgid "How do you think that'd make me look, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3387\t3452"
msgid "Then what should I do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3454\t3527"
msgid "If you really wanna see the boss..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3529\t3598"
msgid "You're gonna have to beat me first!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3600\t3700"
msgid "Huh. Is that it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3703\t3798"
msgid "You don't know who you're\\nmessing with, old man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3800\t3923"
msgid "The captain's not gonna go easy on you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3925\t3960"
msgid "Captain?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3962\t4009"
msgid "You heard me!"
msgstr "Mi hai sentito."

msgctxt "4011\t4118"
msgid "My aniki here is the captain\\nof the Ryudo Family..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4120\t4255"
msgid "The Fighting Viper, Rikiya Shimabukuro-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4263\t4348"
msgid "Now run while you still can, asshole!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4382\t4430"
msgid "Put a sock in it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4433\t4470"
msgid "What was that!?"
msgstr "Cosa hai detto?"

msgctxt "4473\t4602"
msgid "I can't imagine this makes\\nyour family look too good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4604\t4764"
msgid "Don't try n' talk your way outta this,\\nyou fucking coward!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4766\t4868"
msgid "You might be a big shot down here in Okinawa..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4872\t5024"
msgid "But if you think that'll scare me off,\\nyou're just a damn fool."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5218\t5265"
msgid "Hold this for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5465\t5516"
msgid "Well?"
msgstr "Allora?"

msgctxt "5518\t5588"
msgid "Cute snake you've got there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5590\t5646"
msgid "What did you say!?"
msgstr "Che hai detto!?"

msgctxt "5648\t5685"
msgid "It's not a snake!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5687\t5726"
msgid "It's a goddamn viper!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5728\t5807"
msgid "That's why they call me the Fighting Viper!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5811\t5878"
msgid "Doesn't matter to me what it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5880\t6005"
msgid "Well it should! This thing's the symbol of Okinawa!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6008\t6103"
msgid "Got the heart and soul of this island\\nright on my damn back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6105\t6195"
msgid "Safe to say you like your hometown, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6198\t6246"
msgid "Damn right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6261\t6434"
msgid "And now I'm gonna show you\\njust what Okinawa's all about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6497\t6587"
msgid "Mikio! Back off, this one's mine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6651\t6716"
msgid "Ready to rumble?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6723\t6766"
msgid "Ready when you are."
msgstr "Pronto quando vuoi."

msgctxt "6775\t6826"
msgid "Then bring it!"
msgstr ""
